Place your ROMs in this folder.
Tested with the following ROMs:
  6502tube_120.rom            (6502 Tube second-processor firmware, version 1.20)
  AMXMSE331.rom               (AMX mouse support, version 3.31)
  DFS-0.9.rom                 (Acorn Disc Filing System 0.90 for Intel 8271)
  DNFS302.rom                 (Combined disc/network filing systems with Tube host support)
  OS12.rom                    (BBC Micro operating system, version 1.20)
  TERMULATORv1.rom            (Termulator serial terminal software)
  ADFS-1.30.rom               (Acorn Advanced Disc Filing System, version 1.30)
  BASIC2.rom                  (BBC BASIC II language interpreter)
  DFS-2.26.rom                (Acorn Disc Filing System 2.26 for WD1770)
  HiBASIC.rom                 (High-memory BBC BASIC for the 6502 second processor)
  PHROM.rom                   (Acorn speech vocabulary data for the TMS5220 speech system)
  LOGO-1.rom                  (Acornsoft Logo, first ROM)
  LOGO-2-1201387.rom          (Acornsoft Logo, second ROM; both required)
  Logotron LOGO 1.01 1984.rom (Logotron Logo 1.01; single ROM)
